  "cloud.intro": Object.freeze({ en: "This section makes real calls to the AWS cloud MCP: Cognito login → software_test_switch.set → the local Mac worker fetches, verifies the signature, executes the software switch and sends a receipt → software_test_switch.result. Every action needs the local independent operator code first. The Mac key passphrase is typed once, hidden, in the Terminal when the server starts; it never passes through the browser or an environment variable. The login URL is never opened automatically; a submitted callback URL lives only in local server memory and can be used once. The software switch is an in-memory test switch, not a physical device. The same chain can also send home_device.command (one allowlisted action on a paired SIMULATED device) → home_device.result.", zh: "這一區會真的呼叫 AWS 雲端 MCP：Cognito 登入 → software_test_switch.set → 本機 Mac worker 取件、驗簽、執行軟體開關、回執 → software_test_switch.result。每個動作都要先輸入本機獨立操作碼。Mac 金鑰密語只在啟動伺服器時於 Terminal 隱藏輸入一次，不經過瀏覽器、也不放進環境變數。登入網址不會自動開啟；回呼網址送出後只存在本機伺服器記憶體，且只能使用一次。軟體開關是記憶體內測試開關，不是實體裝置。同一條鏈也能送出 home_device.command（對已配對的模擬設備執行一個允許清單內的動作）→ home_device.result。" }),
